  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Punjab Education Endowment Fund to provide scholarships for talented female students from poor households in 16 districts to study at intermediate level; and for male and female students to study at tertiary level.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to Punjab Education Endowment Fund to provide scholarships for talented female students from poor households in 16 districts to study at intermediate level; and for male and female students to study at tertiary level.  is a component of Punjab Education Support Programme II reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xa3;18,995,000. It works in the following sector(s): Higher education, Upper Secondary Education (modified and includes data from 11322).</narrative>
  </description>
